hoto of drip tray.}]<\/a><\/li>\n\n<li>[dt {drip tray cover is our V4 model and made of steel.}] \n<a href='\/photos\/DE-DRIPTRAYCOVERV4_R1-75201'>[dt {Photo}]<\/a>\n\n<li>[dt {natural wood handles.}] [dt {As this is a natural material, the wood grain between the two handles may not match perfectly.}] \n<a href='\/photos\/DE-PFHANDLENATURALV1GRADEB-30027'>[dt {Photo}]<\/a>\n\n<br><br>\n[dt {Due to the upgraded Samsung Galaxy Tab A11 tablet included with MASHUP 2, the price has increased by approximately 1% compared with the previous MASHUP machines.}]\n\n<br><br>\n[dt {Stock is very limited.}] \n[dt {Machines are available on a first-paid, first-served basis.}]\n[dt {Once payment is received, a machine will be randomly assigned, calibrated for your country's electrical requirements, fully tested, and shipped within 3 working days of ordering.}]","url_shop":"de1pro","retail_price_eur":"2637","inventory_at_de":"100","hscode":"8471410150ES:84198100;VN:85167100;US:8471410150","dimensions_height":"61","retail_price_hkd":"23380","dimensions_length":"50","one_liner":"SALE 19%: DE1PRO black 110V MASHUP2 v1.46","morephotos":"DE-DE1PRO110MMV8R2-00566-add-01.jpg,DE-DE1PRO220MMV8R3-00569-add-01.jpg,DE-DE1PRO110MMV8R2-00566-add-02.jpg,DE-DE1PRO110MMV8-00564-add-03.jpg,mashup_versus.jpg"},
