"DE-SPRING15V1-00327":{	"materials":["stainless steel"],"retail_price_cad":"16","discountable":"no","weight":"5","dimensions_width":"2","sold":"409","hscode_default":"7320205060","ship_date":"2020-12-17","retail_price_aud":"16","retail_price_usd":"11","battery_chargeable":"0","ship_weight":"5","retail_price_gbp":"9","multi_liner":"<p>Making the springs of our tamper replaceable was a major priority, as we know that they tend to become easier after about 20,000 tamps. In addition to that, different springs allow for tamping at the calibration you prefer. <\/p> \n<p>No matter whether you decide to tamp with a 25lb or a 30lb spring: you can easily switch to another calibration or just simply replace springs. And that at a very affordable price! <\/p> \n\nFR:\n<p>L'un de nos buts principaux était de concevoir notre tasseur d'une façon qui permet à l'utilisateur de remplacer le ressort, parce que celui-ci devient plus faible après 20,000 tassages environ. En plus, les ressorts différents qui sont disponibles vous permettent le tassage à votre calibration préférée. <\/p> \n<p>Peu importe si vous tassez en utilisant un ressort calibré à 11.3kg ou à 13.6kg, vous pouvez facilement changer la calibration du tasseur ou justement remplacer un ressort affaissé. Et ceci se fait maintenant à un prix très abordable ! <\/p>","url_shop":"tamper","retail_price_eur":"13","inventory_at_de":"500","hscode":"US: 7320205060;CA: 7320200090;EU: 7320208590","dimensions_height":"3.4","retail_price_hkd":"90","dimensions_length":"2","one_liner":"15lb spring for Decent Tamper V2-V5"},
