"DE-DE1XLWHITE220V2D-00441":{	"materials":["food grade stainless steel case", "food grade ceramic water tank and drip tray", "silicone rubber feet", "solid teflon inside tubing", "no BPA plastics."],"customs_price":"500","retail_price_cad":"5149","discountable":"no","weight":"19000","dimensions_width":"47","sold":"1","hscode_default":"85167100","ship_date":"2020-10-07","voltage":"2","retail_price_aud":"5552","retail_price_usd":"3704","battery_chargeable":"0","ship_weight":"22000","retail_price_gbp":"2760","free_shipping":"no","showall_hide":"yes","url_shop":"de1xl","retail_price_eur":"3183","inventory_at_de":"100","hscode":"8471410150ES:84198100; VN:85167100; US:8471410150","dimensions_height":"64","retail_price_hkd":"28880","dimensions_length":"34","one_liner":"DE1XL white 220V v1.3 Discount","sale_parent":"DE-DE1XLWHITE220V2-00220"},
"DE-DE1PRO110NOPLUMBV2D-00427":{	"materials":["food grade stainless steel case", "food grade ceramic water tank and drip tray", "silicone rubber feet", "solid teflon inside tubing", "no BPA plastics."],"customs_price":"500","retail_price_cad":"3627","discountable":"no","weight":"19000","dimensions_width":"47","sold":"0","hscode_default":"85167100","ship_date":"2020-10-07","voltage":"1","retail_price_aud":"3911","retail_price_usd":"2609","battery_chargeable":"0","showall_hide":"yes","ship_weight":"22000","retail_price_gbp":"1944","free_shipping":"no","multi_liner":"<p>This machine achieves rock-solid temperature and pressure with technology, instead of a large metal boiler. A <b>touch tablet<\/b> controls everything. You can either use and tweak existing profiles to make coffee with just a few taps on your tablet or create your own profiles and, that way, explore coffee in whole new ways.<\/p> <p>The following things are included with this machine: <ul><li><b>The espresso machine itself.<\/b> Its small size conceals its tremendous power. Dimensions: 36cm x 32 cm x 22cm.<\/li> <li><b>An Android tablet.<\/b> Bright Samsung LCD screen. 1280x800 resolution. 8 inch screen. Customized and unlocked Android 5.1 operating system. Preloaded with our software.<\/li> <li><b>A Suitcase.<\/b> Custom made travel suitcase. Includes formed, spandex-covered foam to safely hold each component.<\/li> <li><b>Power cable<\/b> A heavy-duty AWG14 power cable using the IEC cable standard.<\/li> <li><b>Drip tray<\/b> Made from food-grade porcelain.<\/li> <li><b>Drip tray cover<\/b> Cast from food-grade aluminum and then electroplated.<\/li> <li><b>Bottomless portafilter,<\/b> Polished solid stainless head. The handle is made from hand-turned and then stained ash wood.<\/li> <li><b>18g basket<\/b> Competition grade coffee filter basket.<\/li> <li><b>Black steelie stand.<\/b> Custom made, black, all metal, magnetic tablet stand.<\/li> <li><b>Blank basket for cleaning.<\/b> Made from stainless steel. Used when running the cleaning cycle with an espresso machine detergent such as Cafiza.<\/li> <li><b>USB tablet charging cable.<\/b> Custom made, with a nylon woven sheath.<\/li> <li><b>Group head handle<\/b> Hand-turned, stained and made from bubinga wood. To help you tighten the portafilter without straining yourself.<\/li> <li><b>Porcelain water tank.<\/b> Made from food-grade porcelain.<\/li><\/ul><\/p> <p>If you buy this product, please contact us so that we can invite you to the exclusive forum for users of our espresso machine.<\/p>","url_shop":"de1pro","retail_price_eur":"2242","inventory_at_de":"100","hscode":"8471410150ES:84198100; VN:85167100; US:8471410150","dimensions_height":"64","retail_price_hkd":"20340","dimensions_length":"34","one_liner":"DE1PRO black 110V v1.1 Discount","sale_parent":"DE-DE1PRO110NOPLUMBV2-00158"},
